    "operations": [
      "All visible pixels generated with accepted forest model/common settings; no drawn/vector limbs or nuts.",
      "The original far forearm lifts beside the muzzle from its original shoulder at original size; foreground forearm/body/strap restored unchanged. Release/capture explicitly return to the original empty-handed pose. No full-body pose regeneration.",
